  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29306001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "您终于回来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "|101|大人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "肚子好饿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "请随我来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "听到您喊肚子饿，总是一件让人难过又甜蜜的事。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "难过，又甜蜜？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "难过的是，没有我在身边的日子，您的胃究竟吃了多少苦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "可一想到您狼吞虎咽的样子，内心又觉得比蜜还甜。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "抱歉，说了不合时宜的话，啊——您的餐巾还没系好！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "忍不住想大快朵颐了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "呵呵……大人也有这样孩子气的一面呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "啊——大人，请等一等。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "怎么了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "您的嘴角——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "呵呵，已经摘去了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不得不说，味道一流。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "得到大人的夸赞了呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29306018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "对我来说，只要看到您填饱肚子的样子，就比什么都开心了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
